//
// VCS coverage scope for the smc DUT. Generated by gen_smc_cov_scope.py from
// the build filelists on the rule the SEP scope states: the bench, the CPU
// subtree, the library cells and one barely-exercised third-party block with
// a bench of its own leave the database; the bench's coverage collectors leave
// the code and toggle metrics and keep their assertions and covergroups; every
// other functional third-party IP stays graded regardless of authorship.
// Dropped design units are named, because they are instantiated inside SMC's
// own modules where no instance tree reaches them. README.md says what stays
// and why.
//
// Regenerate after a build whenever the compiled source set changes.

